OL,3,GNEWSA'I've seen Holy Grail 7,000 times'
OL,4,A- John Cleese
OL,5,
OL,6,FComedy legend John Cleese is going on a
OL,7,Ftheatre tour presenting a screening of
OL,8,Fone of his most famous films, Monty
OL,9,FPython and the Holy Grail.
OL,11,FThe film and TV actor will introduce
OL,12,Fthe 1975 classic British movie as well
OL,13,Fas answer questions from the audience.
OL,15,FThe tour begins in Basingstoke on 1
OL,16,FSeptember and takes in venues including
OL,17,FTunbridge Wells and Woking.
OL,19,FCleese told BBC South East Today: "We
OL,20,Fshow the film, but I don't watch it as
OL,21,FI've seen it over 7,000 times."
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
